# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large / external / regenerable artifacts. Kept out of git on purpose.
# See README ("Data" and "Reproducing") for how to obtain / regenerate them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw RumourEval-2019 corpus (download separately; contains redistributed
# tweet text). Regenerate the processed dataset with `make dataset`.
rumoureval-2019-training-data/

# Trained model weights, LoRA adapters, optimizer/scheduler state, tokenizer
# copies. Regenerate with `make train`.
result/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin

# Regenerable outputs (produced by `make analyze`). The distilled summaries in
# results/*.json|*.csv and the raw prediction dumps in results/raw_predictions/
# ARE tracked; only stray top-level outputs are ignored here.
/confidence_comparison_*.png
/confidence_summary_*.csv

